{"text":"彌勒像一區。比丘法轉仰爲亡父母、因緣眷屬及一切衆生，敬造。大魏正始四年歲次丁亥，六月一日。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":0,"end":2},{"name":"PersonName","term":"法轉","refId":null,"text":"法轉","start":8,"end":10},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"因緣","refId":null,"text":"因緣","start":16,"end":18},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":23,"end":25}]}